\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0   Jesus, a friend of all mankind
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And redeemer of all sinners,
\par You suffered greatly on the cross,
\par Paid for me the price of my sins.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par I shall praise thee for your mercies;
\par Truly thou art merciful Lord;
\par I and lots of these my brothers,
\par I give thanks to you and bow Thee.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. You blessed me with your Salvation,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And thy wealth is bounteous for me;
\par In time of troubles in my sins
\par You  redeemed me with your true love.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par You forgave me my trespasses,
\par And redeemed me from grips of fear
\par With peace and life everlasting
\par Fully filled me in all my heart.
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li405\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Come O Lord and look upon us.
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0 Come and bless us by your table
\par You alone is the true vine tree,
\par That gives life out to your branches
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Help me and strengthen me always
\par That my taste can't overtake me!
\par You  alone through whom I can take
\par \pard       To bear clean, good and healthy fruits.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

